{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/8021","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:49.016070+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"One option here: we currently set padded index values to zero. We could instead set them to the shape of the axis. We would have to be more careful about out-of-bounds indexing in all the various impl rules, but this explicit padding would make situations like this easier to handle.","created_at":"2021-10-11T20:40:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/8021#issuecomment-940426433","id":940426433,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/8021","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc44DcTB","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/940426433/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-10-11T20:40:50Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/940426433","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLA